[38;2;124;124;124mWe have a metric space $(X, d)$ and functions $F_\varepsilon, F: X \to [-\infty,[0m[38;2;124;124;124m\infty]$. The sequence $\{F_\varepsilon\}$ is equicoercive, meaning for all $t [0m
[38;2;124;124;124m\in \mathbb{R}$, there exists a compact set $K_t$ such that $\{x : [0m
